{"seq":1,"slug":"recall-ranking-pipeline","title":"召回-排序多阶段流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/systems/recall-ranking-pipeline","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"召回-排序多阶段流水线\">召回-排序多阶段流水线</h1><p>一个服务十亿用户的推荐系统面对的候选物品池可能有数亿之巨。即使最快的排序模型，对每个用户逐一打分也需要数小时。工业级推荐系统的解决方案是一条精心设计的漏斗型多阶段流水线——每一阶段以不同的精度/速度权衡逐步缩小候选集，最终在数十毫秒内从亿级候选中精选出几十个结果呈现给用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多阶段流水线的设计哲学是<strong>精度与效率的阶梯式权衡</strong>：越靠前的阶段处理的候选越多，模型越轻；越靠后的阶段候选越少，模型越重、越精准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;全量候选池&lt;br/&gt;~10亿物品&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;召回 Recall&lt;br/&gt;~10000 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;10ms&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;粗排 Pre-ranking&lt;br/&gt;~1000 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;20ms&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;精排 Ranking&lt;br/&gt;~200 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;50ms&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;重排 Re-ranking&lt;br/&gt;~50 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;10ms&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;最终展示&lt;br/&gt;~20 物品&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"全量候选池&lt;br/&gt;~10亿物品\"] --&gt; B[\"召回 Recall&lt;br/&gt;~10000 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;10ms\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"粗排 Pre-ranking&lt;br/&gt;~1000 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;20ms\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"精排 Ranking&lt;br/&gt;~200 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;50ms\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"重排 Re-ranking&lt;br/&gt;~50 候选&lt;br/&gt;延迟: &lt;10ms\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"最终展示&lt;br/&gt;~20 物品\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>候选规模</th>\n<th>模型复杂度</th>\n<th>延迟预算</th>\n<th>核心任务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回</td>\n<td>亿→万</td>\n<td>低（双塔/索引）</td>\n<td>&lt;10ms</td>\n<td>覆盖率优先，不遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粗排</td>\n<td>万→千</td>\n<td>中（轻量网络）</td>\n<td>&lt;20ms</td>\n<td>粗粒度过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精排</td>\n<td>千→百</td>\n<td>高（复杂特征交互）</td>\n<td>&lt;50ms</td>\n<td>精准预估 CTR/CVR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排</td>\n<td>百→十</td>\n<td>中（列表级优化）</td>\n<td>&lt;10ms</td>\n<td>多样性/业务规则/去重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"召回阶段\">召回阶段</h2><p>召回是整个流水线的入口——必须在极短时间内从全量候选中捞出用户可能感兴趣的几千到几万个物品。&quot;宁可误杀不可遗漏&quot;是召回的核心原则，因为被召回阶段过滤掉的物品在后续阶段不可能被找回来。</p>\n<p><strong>多路召回策略</strong>是工业界的标配做法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协同过滤路</strong>：基于 ItemCF 的 I2I 相似物品召回</li>\n<li><strong>向量召回路</strong>：双塔模型 + ANN 索引（FAISS/ScaNN/HNSW）</li>\n<li><strong>热门召回路</strong>：全局/分类热门物品兜底</li>\n<li><strong>实时召回路</strong>：基于用户最近行为的实时触发</li>\n<li><strong>图召回路</strong>：图上随机游走或 GNN embedding 检索</li>\n</ul>\n<p>各路召回结果合并去重后进入下一阶段。实践中通常维护 5-10 条召回路，每条贡献不同视角的候选。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ann-索引技术\">ANN 索引技术</h3><p>向量召回的核心基础设施是近似最近邻（ANN）索引：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FAISS（Meta）</strong>：支持 IVF、HNSW、PQ 等多种索引结构，GPU 加速</li>\n<li><strong>ScaNN（Google）</strong>：各向异性量化，在大规模数据上比 FAISS 更快</li>\n<li><strong>HNSW</strong>：分层可导航小世界图，查询复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，精度最高但内存占用大</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"粗排阶段\">粗排阶段</h2><p>粗排是 2019 年后工业界普遍引入的阶段——当召回量从几千扩大到几万后，精排模型算力不足以逐一打分，需要一个中间层做快速过滤。</p>\n<p>粗排模型的设计原则：<strong>尽可能逼近精排的排序质量，同时保持 10 倍以上的速度优势</strong>。</p>\n<p>常见方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>知识蒸馏</strong>：用精排模型作为 teacher，训练一个轻量 student 模型</li>\n<li><strong>特征裁剪</strong>：只使用精排特征的一个子集（去掉计算昂贵的交叉特征）</li>\n<li><strong>双塔 + 轻量交互</strong>：在双塔基础上加一层简单的特征交互</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"精排阶段\">精排阶段</h2><p>精排是推荐质量的核心——使用最复杂的模型、最丰富的特征来精准预估每个候选的点击率（CTR）、转化率（CVR）、预期时长等指标。</p>\n<p>现代精排模型的典型架构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>Tower</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>CrossNet</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Embedding</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y} = \\text{Tower}(\\text{CrossNet}(\\text{Embedding}(x_{user}, x_{item}, x_{context})))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tower</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CrossNet</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Embedding</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>特征交互模块（CrossNet/DCN-V2/DeepFM）负责自动学习高阶特征组合。模型参数量可达数十亿，但由于候选规模已缩小到数百，单次请求的计算量可控。</p>\n<p><strong>多目标精排</strong>是工业实践的主流——同时预估 CTR、CVR、完播率、互动率等多个目标，然后通过加权公式融合为最终排序分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = w_1 \\cdot pCTR + w_2 \\cdot pCVR + w_3 \\cdot pDuration + \\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">pC</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">pC</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"重排阶段\">重排阶段</h2><p>精排输出的是按照个体分数排序的列表，但最终呈现需要考虑<strong>列表级别</strong>的目标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多样性</strong>：连续推荐同品类物品会导致用户疲劳，需要打散</li>\n<li><strong>新鲜度</strong>：适当穿插新物品以保持内容生态健康</li>\n<li><strong>业务规则</strong>：广告插入位置、品牌曝光约束、合规过滤</li>\n<li><strong>上下文去重</strong>：避免推荐用户刚看过的内容</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重排算法从规则引擎（MMR、滑动窗口去重）逐步演进到学习型方法（PRM、SetRank），后者直接优化列表级指标如 NDCG 和用户满意度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多阶段流水线是工业推荐系统的标准架构，通过阶梯式精度-效率权衡在毫秒内完成推荐</li>\n<li>召回追求覆盖率，多路并行是标配；精排追求精准，复杂模型+丰富特征是关键</li>\n<li>粗排是大规模系统的必要中间层，知识蒸馏是其核心技术</li>\n<li>重排从列表级视角优化多样性和业务约束</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"feature-engineering\">特征工程与实时特征</a>——各阶段模型所依赖的特征体系</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform\">A/B 测试实验平台</a>——如何科学评估流水线各阶段的在线效果</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"召回-排序多阶段流水线","id":"召回-排序多阶段流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"召回阶段","id":"召回阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"ANN 索引技术","id":"ann-索引技术"},{"level":2,"text":"粗排阶段","id":"粗排阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"精排阶段","id":"精排阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"重排阶段","id":"重排阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"图推荐模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/deep-learning/graph-based-recommendation"},"next":{"title":"推荐系统特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/systems/feature-engineering"}}